    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Run the specified eight-cell simulation from undifferentiated co-located states and record trajectories, fate probabilities, and ensemble free energy. The claim is supported if migration precedes differentiation near step eight and contextual fate ambiguity resolves; otherwise it is refuted.";
